eorg-action = That would be end-of-round griefing!
eor-pacifism-blocked = Pacifism has NOT been enabled, there is an active threat on the evac shuttle making its way to Central Command!
eor-pacifism-reblocked = Pacifism has been disabled.
eor-pacifism-unblocked = The threat has been neutralized, pacifism is now enabled.

eor-zed-threat = Attention Central Command Outpost: Romerol Infection detected onboard Evacuation Shuttle. Quarantine Protocol has been enacted, and the on site nuclear warhead is now on standby. Unauthorized shuttle arrivals or departures will be bombarded with bluespace artillery to maintain quarantine. Eradicate the outbreak and recover Contractor Assets.
eor-zed-takeover = Attention Central Command Outpost: Romerol Infection has overrun the Outpost. NanoTrasen Special Forces and the NanoTrasen Naval Corps have been notified. Please prepare for nuclear cleansing, per Quarantine Protocols. Thank you for your service, and have a lovely afterlife.
eor-zed-clear = Attention Central Command Outpost: Romerol Infection has been quelled, and the on site nuclear warhead has been deactivated. Please recover and clone all viable Contractor Assets, and cleanse infected material from the Outpost. Quarantine Protocol will be lifted in 24 hours. Have a lovely day.
eor-nukie-threat =Attention Central Command Outpost: The station's self destruct mechanism is onboard the evacuation shuttle. Bastion protocol is now in effect and the armory has been unlocked. All personnel are required to defend this installation, eradicate the nuclear threat, and prevent the arming of the self destruct mechanism.
eor-nukie-clear = Attention Central Command Outpost: The nuclear threat has been neutralized. Bastion protocol has been lifted. Please secure the self destruct mechanism and return all armory equipment. Have a lovely day.

eor-cassie = C.A.S.S.I.E.
